; desktop/installer.nsi.tmpl — server-side Windows installer authoring (NSIS).
; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; Why NSIS and not Inno (the CI's tool), measured 2026-08-01 on the
; server-side build box (epic pt_ce426157):
;   * iscc must run under our userspace Wine (no cross-build server) — but
;     EVERY 32-bit Windows app measured (Inno's own installer, innounp)
;     HANGS under the new WoW64 without the preloader (seccomp SIGSYS);
;     64-bit apps work. Inno 6's iscc is 32-bit, and the Inno 7 x64
;     installer (our only way to get a 64-bit iscc) is itself 32-bit-hosted
;     and hangs. Extraction without the installer fails too (7-Zip 23.01
;     cannot read Inno 7's container).
;   * makensis runs NATIVELY on Linux (conda-forge nsis): no wine, no
;     display, deterministic. That determinism is what a release pipeline
;     needs most.
; The CI keeps its Inno authoring (.github/workflows/build-desktop.yml).
; The two authorings are bound by tests/test_installer_parity.py, which
; asserts they agree on the semantic contract (app name, install dir,
; privilege level, shortcuts, launch-after-install, output name, payload
; contents, wizard branding, preseed file). The contract — not the tool —
; is the single source of truth.
;
; ── The 2026-08-04 modernization (owner: "the installer looks 2000s") ──
; The classic MUI2 wizard (gray sidebar bitmap, MS Shell Dlg 8, bevels)
; is replaced by a fully custom nsDialogs wizard:
;   * EVERY page is one full-page bitmap (rendered at wrap time by
;     lib/desktop_dist/installer_art.py into ART_DIR) + real controls.
;     Only the brand name/version is baked into the art; every sentence
;     is a real LangString label sitting on a #F0F0F0 card (the conda
;     nsDialogs has NO control-coloring, so labels must sit on COLOR_3DFACE
;     plates baked into the page art — du coordinates shared both sides).
;   * Modern type: Segoe UI / Microsoft YaHei UI labels via CreateFont,
;     DPI-scaled; ManifestDPIAware for crisp chrome.
;   * Speed: /SOLID lzma (measured 2026-08-04: 53.2 MB → 45.2 MB on the
;     agent) and NO per-file log pane (the classic details list repainted
;     3316 times during File /r — a marquee bar replaces it).
;   * Silent mode (/S) still installs fully (pages are skipped, so the
;     install body lives in DoInstall, callable without UI).
; Runtime verification boundary: 32-bit apps cannot run on this build
; box's wine (SIGSYS), so makensis compile + the parity/ratchet suites +
; the art render tests are the gates; first pixel-level proof rides the
; owner's real-machine acceptance (same gate as epic pt_59b62951aad2463e).
;
; Placeholders (rendered by lib/desktop_dist/winbuilder.py::_render_nsi).
; They are named here WITHOUT their @@ delimiters ON PURPOSE: the
; renderer is a global string replace, and a code-valued placeholder
; expanding inside a comment inserts code outside any function — makensis
; aborts. Never write an @-delimited token in a comment.
;   APP_VERSION          e.g. 0.16.0
;   PAYLOAD_DIR          absolute path of the unpacked payload (contains the
;                        app exe and, when pre-seeded, preseed_server.json)
;   OUT_FILE             absolute output path for the .exe
;   ASSET_DIR            repo static/icons dir (the tofu.ico app icon)
;   ART_DIR              wrap-time rendered wizard pages (welcome.bmp,
;                        directory.bmp, progress.bmp, finish.bmp)
;   APP_NAME             display name (Tofu / Tofu Agent)
;   APP_EXE              payload exe (Tofu.exe / TofuAgent.exe)
;   INSTALL_DIR_NAME     dir under $LOCALAPPDATA\Programs (Tofu / TofuAgent)
;   AUTOSTART_DECL       'Var ChkAutoStart' or empty
;   AUTOSTART_PAGE       checkbox creation block on the directory page
;                        (agent only) or empty
;   AUTOSTART_INSTALL    registry write inside DoInstall (agent only)
;   AUTOSTART_UNINSTALL  matching DeleteRegValue, or empty
; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

!define APP_NAME      "@APP_NAME@"
!define APP_VERSION   "@APP_VERSION@"
!define PUBLISHER     "Tofu Project"
!define APP_EXE       "@APP_EXE@"

Unicode True
SetCompressor /SOLID lzma
SetCompressorDictSize 32
ManifestDPIAware true
XPStyle on

Name "${APP_NAME}"
Caption "${APP_NAME}"
OutFile "@OUT_FILE@"
Icon "@ASSET_DIR@/tofu.ico"
UninstallIcon "@ASSET_DIR@/tofu.ico"
RequestExecutionLevel user          ; per-user install, no UAC — the Inno
                                    ; authoring's PrivilegesRequired=lowest
InstallDir "$LOCALAPPDATA\Programs\@INSTALL_DIR_NAME@"
BrandingText " "                    ; blank the stock stub footer
ShowInstDetails nevershow           ; no log pane exists in the new UI

!include "LogicLib.nsh"
!include "nsDialogs.nsh"
!include "WinMessages.nsh"

LoadLanguageFile "${NSISDIR}\Contrib\Language files\English.nlf"
LoadLanguageFile "${NSISDIR}\Contrib\Language files\SimpChinese.nlf"

!ifndef PBS_MARQUEE
  !define PBS_MARQUEE 0x08
!endif
!ifndef LR_LOADFROMFILE
  !define LR_LOADFROMFILE 0x10
!endif

